cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use trusty-sim in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "trusty-sim"
type: software
abstract: >-
  trusty-sim is a physics simulation library for deformable solids, shells,
  rods, articulated affine bodies, reduced-order (subspace) bodies and MPM,
  with IPC-style frictional contact between them. It runs on CPU and GPU.
authors:
  - family-names: "Trusty"
    given-names: "Ty"
version: "0.1.0a7"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
url: "https://tytrusty.github.io/trusty-docs/"
repository: "https://github.com/tytrusty/trusty-docs"
keywords:
  - physics simulation
  - finite element method
  - contact
  - material point method
  - rigid and deformable bodies
